	(text "SLOT TEMPLATE - SMD rail selector and buffered 5V indicator.\nTPS2116DRLR: VIN1 = 5V_SYS, VIN2 = +3.3V; MODE = VBUS_PROT.\nSEL / VSLOT are sheet pins connected to SEL_n / VSLOT_n in the parent.\nThe switch carries logic only; module current flows through the power mux."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "073f1a7a-50c9-56b9-9897-a1c58863ff8c")
	)
	(text "Rail select uses manual mode (MODE = VBUS_PROT). VSUPPLY_n carries\nthe selected rail on all five pins; GND_n carries ground on all five pins.\nNo programmable per-slot current limit. See POWER.md for system limits."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "682f2ddf-1410-5be4-8990-ddb7ea9e594e")
	)
	(text "5V position: SW pin 2 connects to pin 3 (VBUS_PROT); SEL high selects 5V_SYS.\n3V3 position: SW pin 2 connects to unused pin 1; the retained 100k resistor\npulls SEL low and selects +3.3V. Q drives the LED without loading SEL.\nThe LED supply is 5V_SYS. RESET pulls the 3.3V rail low, not SEL or MODE;\na 3V3-selected slot is not switched to 5V by pressing RESET."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 135.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "74465663-d0c5-5eeb-9b4b-b29795ca8c5f")
	)
	(text "Per-instance refs: Slot1 = U6 / SW2 / Q1 / D4 / R62 / R29 / C22 / C23.\nSlot12 = U17 / SW13 / Q12 / D15 / R73 / R51 / C44 / C45.\nVSUPPLY_1..12 and GND1..12 remain the mating sockets.\nJ7..J18 shunt jumpers were replaced by SW2..SW13."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "be379f48-1f23-537f-b69a-5606db122eb8")
	)

